DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Public Library\\nCost: free\\nAges: 0-60 mo
 nths\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nJoin us and our friends from The Village C
 hicago for our monthly Memory Café. It’s a relaxed\, friendly place for
  people with memory loss and their care partners. Meet new people\, enjoy 
 lunch\, and have fun together! Activities at this event will be thematic a
 nd will include games\, arts and crafts\, music\, and more. Friends\, fami
 ly members\, and community allies also are welcome. Registration is requir
 ed and lunch will be served. Accessibility Need sign language interpretati
 on or other accessibility\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.
 com/events/6a05e8f843b41b3d00666fb5
