BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[FREE] Film Screening: Roll Bounce (2005)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20260712T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20260712T153000
DTSTAMP:20260626T105252Z
UID:0e741d85f53cb43757023f5f670e0776@family-events-agent
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:storytime,library,baby,toddler,reading
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Public Library\\nCost: free\\nAges: 0-60 mo
 nths\\nCategory: Film & Events\\n\\nJoin us for a screening of Roll Bounce
 . There's nothing Lil' about rapper Bow Wow's big-time performance in this
  amiable\, entertaining coming-of-age tale\, anchored by the strain betwee
 n a widower (Chi McBride) and his son (Bow Wow)\, who's caught up in the r
